    "about": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Shoaib Ghulam",
        "position": "Fullstack Web Developer",
        "description": "<p>\r\nHi, my name is Shoaib Ghulam. I am a highly experienced Fullstack Web Application Developer with over 5 years of professional expertise. During this time, I have successfully developed more than 50 custom applications using Django and Express.js, showcasing my strong command over modern web technologies. My core responsibilities include designing and implementing scalable frontend and backend architectures, ensuring optimal performance and user experience for new projects.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nI specialize in creating intuitive, responsive user interfaces while maintaining robust and secure backend systems. I am also skilled at refactoring and upgrading existing codebases, employing modern best practices to enhance maintainability, scalability, and readability, which helps teams collaborate effectively.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMy deep understanding of software development enables me to translate complex requirements into efficient and reliable applications, making significant contributions to project success. I am passionate about leveraging technology to solve real-world problems and delivering impactful solutions for my clients.\r\n</p>",
        "image": "/asset/images/sd.jpg"
    },
